{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/extras/8ba0210afb3b98478711cf91637180c6.avif?t=1769270979\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zaetherfall</strong> is a <strong>visual novel / shmup</strong> focused on a war of factions, propaganda, and decisions made at the edge. Three rival aces\u2014<strong>URA</strong>, <strong>EUPRA</strong>, and the <strong>Sacred Eastern Dominion</strong>\u2014are forced to cooperate as <strong>Zael Aether</strong> advances as an absolutist theocracy that never negotiates: it <strong>purifies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, the campaign unfolds through <strong>visual novel interludes</strong>: political tension, cultural clashes, fragile alliances, and the true cost of holding together a coalition that should never have existed. Every faction carries its own internal dramas. In combat, those same fractures surface as <strong>real-time communications</strong>: orders, friction, pressure\u2026 and silences that say more than any speech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In gameplay, Zaetherfall blends arcade pace with clear tools:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-ups, projectiles, and missiles</strong> to control the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire and Plasma weapons</strong> to adapt to every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two shields with short windows and real cooldowns</strong>:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plasma Shield</strong> (<i>anti-projectile</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire Shield</strong> (<i>anti-missile</i>)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level culminates in a duel against a <strong>Zael Aether Commander</strong>: <strong>multi-phase</strong> bosses with patterns that shift, tighten, and escalate until they break you\u2026 or make you stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VISUAL NOVEL + SHMUP</strong>: a story driven by factions, ideology, and political conflict\u2014built around intense action between scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THREE PROTAGONISTS, ONE WAR</strong>: three perspectives with clashing identities and cultures inside the same cockpit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMBAT WITH REAL TOOLS</strong>: power-ups, projectiles, and missiles to shape the flow of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUAL TACTICAL DEFENSE</strong>: Plasma Shield (anti-projectile) / Fire Shield (anti-missile), both with short duration and real cooldowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUELS AGAINST COMMANDERS</strong>: multi-phase bosses and phase transitions that reshape every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REAL-TIME REACTIVE COMMS</strong>: orders, taunts, and last words that track waves, breaks, and boss transitions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE PILOTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zack V\u00e1squez \u2014 \u201cThe Spear of the Americas\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroic, impulsive, and head-on. His greatest strength is pushing forward; his greatest risk is not knowing when to stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/extras/7b28e653fd908d084e568a1c80cce932.avif?t=1769270979\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ekaterina V\u00e4is\u00e4nen \u2014 \u201cThe Mind of Europe\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disciplined tactical leader. She believes in unity and teamwork to carry out the mission at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/extras/2fc9ebec476084e7bfb596614594f0ad.avif?t=1769270979\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wei Zhang \u2014 \u201cThe Silence of the East\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise, steady, restrained. He fights an inner war\u2014one that demands he believe blindly in his nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/extras/1051abfb2f8a92c98ba2bb9ed3874827.avif?t=1769270979\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE DOCTRINE OF ZAEL AETHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They do not speak: they <strong>purify</strong>. Empire as religion\u2014blood, steel, and void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They call it the Silent Divinity. We call it <strong>extinction</strong>. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/extras/4e9b0fb6b7c303d31bc001ea922719a8.avif?t=1769270979\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stand with your own. Defy the divine. Burn their heaven.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081670?t=1769270979","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/0bc70774137fc3c58dae4ce5d8e194f8f8af2ec6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769270979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/a2d274f7ff396c2d1f93b845b0bb65e3d8c95081/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769270979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/a2d274f7ff396c2d1f93b845b0bb65e3d8c95081/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769270979","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4085610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/408